meta {
  name: 76 Branch Settings
  seq: 76
}

docs {
  # Branch Settings

  Branch Admin › Branch Settings — branch-wide behaviour switches that the Branch
  Admin owns (not the lab staff who use the Technician screens). Tenant-scoped
  (RLS) + branch-level: the branch is always the caller's ACTIVE branch from the
  JWT, never a body field.

  In the app: Branch Admin sidebar > BRANCH SETTINGS > Technician Settings
  (`/branch-admin/branch-settings/technician-settings`).

  Today it holds **Report Printing**: whether the technician may choose, per
  report, which Notes sections print (one switch for a single lab test, one for a
  test that belongs to a lab panel). The values are stored in the branch's
  `technician_settings` row, which the print code reads.

  Permissions (module `branch_admin`, section "Branch Settings"):
  - `branch_admin:branch_settings__view_branch_settings` - read
  - `branch_admin:branch_settings__update_branch_settings` - save

  A Branch Admin holds both by default; lab technician, Registration and Accession
  roles do not. Business Admin has no active branch, so use a Branch Admin token
  (`{{businessAccessToken}}` logged in as a Branch Admin).
}
